title: Negotiations with United States
view-if: cyprus_mode != 0 and cyprus_atilla1_ending_seen == 1 and cyprus_campaign_resolved == 0
new-page: true

= Negotiations with United States

Attitude: [+ us_attitude : cyprus_attitude +]. Diplomatic leverage: [+ leverage_points +].

Denktaş proposes a northern Turkish and southern Greek federal structure. Güneş proposes six geographically separate autonomous Turkish cantons within a federal Cyprus.

- @improve: Improve diplomatic confidence.
- @denktas: Negotiate support for the Denktaş Plan.
- @gunes: Negotiate support for the Güneş Plan.
- @ratify_denktas: Conclude the Denktaş settlement.
- @ratify_gunes: Conclude the Güneş settlement.
- @return: Return to the campaign.

@improve
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomacyUnavailable(Q,'us','improve')===''; !}
subtitle: 1 diplomatic leverage.
unavailable-subtitle: Requires leverage and the relevant military, airport, UN and foreign-attitude conditions. Outreach has a three-day cooldown; a country cannot endorse the same plan twice.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomaticAction(Q,'us','improve'); !}
new-page: true

= Diplomatic report

[+ cyprus_campaign_last_text +]

- @return: Return to the campaign.

@denktas
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomacyUnavailable(Q,'us','denktas')===''; !}
subtitle: 1 diplomatic leverage.
unavailable-subtitle: Requires leverage and the relevant military, airport, UN and foreign-attitude conditions. Outreach has a three-day cooldown; a country cannot endorse the same plan twice.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomaticAction(Q,'us','denktas'); !}
